              <node index="0" text="Yes, of course. You can spread the word about the apps or give good feedback and ratings. You can also help by translating the apps in a new language, or just update some existing translations. The guide to translating is at this website, or just contact us at hello@fossify.org if you have any questions. " resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="org.fossify.clock" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[56,1978][1384,2329]" />
